# OCaml: The OCaml Manual (5.1), chapter "The OCaml language", Lexical conventions; requirements/languages/ocaml.md
name     ocaml ml mli

keyword  and as assert begin class constraint do done downto else end exception external for fun function
keyword  functor if in include inherit initializer lazy let match method module mutable new nonrec object
keyword  of open private rec sig struct then to try type val virtual when while with
builtin  true false print_endline print_string print_int Printf List Array String failwith raise ignore
builtin  not fst snd ref
type     int float string bool unit char list option array exn

ident-part     '
block-comment  (* *)  : nested
string   {| |}  : multiline
string   " "    : escapes multiline
escape        : x=2 octal=3 u-braces
number        : no-leading-dot
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~@.
upper-type
hook     apostrophe
